		/*
		 * Every stock base label the factory dtbo (and the bootloader
		 * itself) may ask for has to resolve, not just the ones the
		 * fragments target: carrying only our own few hundred names made
		 * the bootloader bail straight back to fastboot, while an image
		 * that also carried the stock base's whole name set booted.
		 * These are the stock names this tree does not otherwise define,
		 * each parked on its own empty node so nothing lands on a real one.
		 */
